cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "Embodied Post-Processing Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A configurable, resumable, and auditable post-acquisition pipeline that turns
  raw multi-camera human demonstrations into trainable LeRobot datasets, with an
  explicit quality gate at every stage: episode manifests, causal 15 Hz time
  alignment, two-view hand pose, stereo metric wrist recovery, demonstrated
  gripper priors, robot retargeting and IK, per-episode auditing, and packing
  with normalization statistics.
type: software
